{
 "version": 3,
 "meta": {
  "name": "vqa_count_objects",
  "description": "Reference for the counting VQA case: observe the table, ask the VLM how many grocery items are present (excluding the basket), and report the number. No manipulation. Proves the perceive->report plumbing and that the reported-number criterion accepts a produced answer."
 },
